Hi All,

The m68knommu git tree is now back on git.kernel.org.
You can get at it in the same location as the old kernel.org:

http://git.kernel.org/?p=linux/kernel/git/gerg/m68knommu.git;a=summary

The current interesting branches:

  for-linus -- what I will ask Linux to pull in the next merge window
  for-next  -- what is being pulled into linux-next
  cfmmu     -- work-in-progressto support MMU on ColdFire

I won't be updating the m68knommu git tree on github any longer. And
in the very near future I will ask Stephen Rothwell to pull the
m68knommu for-next branch from kernel.org instead of github.

Regards
Greg


